# Knob acceleration: a few clicks are exact at any speed, a quick spin sweeps. Tonic BD K2 (sound0.0.1, 0..127) starts at 60.
wait 300
tap ENV
expect sound0.0.1 60
# slow, 80 ms a detent: one step each
turn K2 5 80
expect sound0.0.1 65
# quick, 10 ms a detent: the first three one each, then 8 each, so ten detents sweep most of the range
turn K2 10 10
expect sound0.0.1 124
# three quick clicks (30 ms apart): one each, no acceleration
wait 500
turn K2 -3 30
expect sound0.0.1 121
# a quick full sweep down, then fine steps back up
wait 500
turn K2 -20 10
expect sound0.0.1 0
wait 500
turn K2 2 100
expect sound0.0.1 2
# tempo (wide range): slow is 1 BPM a detent; a quick spin, after its first three, 16
press HOME
turn SELECT 3 100
expect tempo 128
turn SELECT 4 10
release HOME
expect tempo 147
